    BRANCH
        IF `the person directly or indirectly gives or offers, or agrees to give or offer, to a minister of the government or an official, or to anyone for the benefit of a minister or an official, a reward, advantage or benefit of any kind` AND `it is as consideration for cooperation, assistance, exercise of influence, or an act or omission, by that minister or official` AND (`in connection with the transaction of business with, or any matter of business relating to, the government` OR `in connection with a claim against Her Majesty or any benefit that Her Majesty is authorized or is entitled to bestow` OR `in connection with the appointment of any person, including themselves, to an office`) THEN JUST TRUE
