      `for the purpose of promoting the election of a candidate or a class or party of candidates to Parliament or the legislature of a province` IS A BOOLEAN
      `with intent to influence or affect in any way the result of an election conducted for the purpose of electing persons to serve in Parliament or the legislature of a province` IS A BOOLEAN
