      `the person has in their possession for the purpose of sale a tobacco product, or raw leaf tobacco that is not packaged` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the tobacco product or raw leaf tobacco is stamped` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the answer of s 121.1(2)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the answer of s 121.1(3)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 121.1(1) the person deals in unstamped tobacco` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the tobacco product or raw leaf tobacco is stamped` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "unless it is stamped"
        IF (`the answer of s 121.1(2)` EQUALS JUST TRUE) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subsection (1) does not apply"
        IF (`the answer of s 121.1(3)` EQUALS JUST TRUE) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "does not contravene subsection (1)"
        IF (`the person sells, offers for sale, transports, delivers or distributes a tobacco product, or raw leaf tobacco that is not packaged` OR `the person has in their possession for the purpose of sale a tobacco product, or raw leaf tobacco that is not packaged`) THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

