      `to abstain from voting at a meeting of the municipal council or a committee of the council` IS A BOOLEAN
      `to vote in favour of or against a measure, motion or resolution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `to aid in procuring or preventing the adoption of a measure, motion or resolution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `to perform or fail to perform an official act` IS A BOOLEAN
